[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba/zvec/issues/comments/6072886840","html_url":"https://github.com/alibaba/zvec/issues/794#issuecomment-6072886840","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba/zvec/issues/794","id":6072886840,"node_id":"IC_kwDOQjAFnc8AAAABafjmOA","user":{"login":"richyreachy","id":246201115,"node_id":"U_kgDODqy7Gw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/246201115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy","html_url":"https://github.com/richyreachy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richyreachy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T02:16:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T02:16:52Z","body":"Hi @JasonXuDeveloper \n\nThe multiplication itself is safe: each operand is at most 255, so the product fits in a 32-bit int. This appears to be an MSVC optimizer regression.\n\nThe issue reports that changing the cast to int64_t avoids the crash without changing the result:\n```\nsum_squared += static_cast<int64_t>(codes[i]) * codes[i];\n```\nThis looks like a reasonable workaround, pending verification in Windows ARM64 CI.\n\n@JalinWang please take a look at this issue.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alibaba/zvec/issues/comments/6072886840/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoo